      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Last June I called your attention to the fact that $2,500 in 72 cash prizes were offered to civil service employees for suggested ways to promote greater municipal efficiency and economy. The employees in several departments and boards have responded in a manner which reflects the interest and cooperation of their heads.",
